1
00:00:00,869 --> 00:00:02,869
(Leonard:)Hey.

2
00:00:02,871 --> 00:00:04,701
(Sheldon:)What are you trying to pull?

3
00:00:04,706 --> 00:00:08,006
(Sheldon:)The president of
science isn't in here.

4
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:10,910
(Leonard:)You lie down, he'll be here
in a minute.

5
00:00:12,414 --> 00:00:14,044
(Leonard:)Okay.

6
00:00:14,049 --> 00:00:15,979
(Leonard:)Hey, I thought you were
trying to trick me.

7
00:00:19,021 --> 00:00:20,851
(Penny:)Now, you just
get comfortable.

8
00:00:20,856 --> 00:00:23,426
(Sheldon:)No, no, comfort is the enemy.

9
00:00:23,425 --> 00:00:24,855
(Sheldon:)You know what's comfortable?

10
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:28,300
(Sheldon:)Slippers and blankets
and panda bears.

11
00:00:29,865 --> 00:00:33,805
(Sheldon:)Imagine a panda bear with
Richard Feynman's face on it.

12
00:00:35,237 --> 00:00:38,367
(Sheldon:)Warm up the car, Leonard,
it's poster time.

13
00:00:38,373 --> 00:00:40,203
(Leonard:)Maybe in the morning.

14
00:00:40,209 --> 00:00:41,539
(Penny:)Yeah, you get
some sleep.

15
00:00:41,543 --> 00:00:44,043
(Sheldon:)No, I don't want to go
to sleep-- you can't make me.

16
00:00:44,046 --> 00:00:45,376
(Penny:)You're right, we can't.

17
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,750
(Sheldon:)Yeah, darn straight, you can't.

18
00:00:46,748 --> 00:00:48,218
(Sheldon:)Try to tell a grown man
to go to sleep...

19
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:51,047
♪ Soft kitty ♪

20
00:00:51,053 --> 00:00:53,053
♪ Warm kitty ♪

21
00:00:53,055 --> 00:00:55,585
♪ Little ball of fur... ♪

22
00:00:55,591 --> 00:00:58,091
(Sheldon:)That's not gonna work.

23
00:00:58,093 --> 00:01:01,633
♪ Happy kitty,
sleepy kitty ♪

24
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:02,630
♪ Purr ♪

25
00:01:02,631 --> 00:01:05,461
BOTH:
♪ Purr, purr. ♪

26
00:01:08,237 --> 00:01:10,907
(Leonard:)You know, he can be
a lot of trouble,

27
00:01:10,906 --> 00:01:13,906
(Leonard:)but when I see him lying
here asleep like this,

28
00:01:13,909 --> 00:01:16,439
(Leonard:)I just think...

29
00:01:16,445 --> 00:01:19,515
(Leonard:)how easy it would be to
hold a pillow over his face.

30
00:01:25,587 --> 00:01:28,157
Wow, you look like
you got some rest.

31
00:01:28,157 --> 00:01:30,157
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm feeling
much better.

32
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:32,329
(Sheldon:)And I've also been
continuing to make progress

33
00:01:32,327 --> 00:01:35,097
(Sheldon:)without artificially
raising my anxiety levels.

34
00:01:35,097 --> 00:01:37,927
(Leonard:)I turned on the heat in my car
and some vomit came out,

35
00:01:37,933 --> 00:01:39,133
(Leonard:)so my levels--
right up there.

36
00:01:39,134 --> 00:01:41,164
(Raj:)Hey, guys.

37
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:42,670
(Raj:)Mind if Emily
joins us for lunch?

38
00:01:42,671 --> 00:01:43,971
(Leonard:)Yeah, sure.
Yeah, no problem.
Of course not.

39
00:01:43,972 --> 00:01:46,942
(Emily:)So I hear you guys have been
playing a little game.

40
00:01:46,942 --> 00:01:50,182
(Howard:)Well, um, we were
just kidding around.

41
00:01:50,179 --> 00:01:52,779
(Emily:)Well, you may think it's funny
that Raj is sweet and sensitive,

42
00:01:52,781 --> 00:01:54,851
(Emily:)but I think it's sexy.

43
00:01:58,453 --> 00:02:01,523
(Emily:)Ugh, why is there dog hair
in your mouth?

